# MISC-MH-02: A hint 0 0 9 9 read at the default grid, then a file at magscale 1 2 with the same hint (the grid becomes 1/2), then scalegrid 1 2; the hint values after each step; writeall.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/t -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load input/a
property MASKHINTS_X
load input/b
property MASKHINTS_X
load input/a
property MASKHINTS_X
scalegrid 1 2
property MASKHINTS_X
load input/b
property MASKHINTS_X
writeall force
